[Verified Translation (Yorùbá -> English)]:
- Yorùbá Sentence: Ààrẹ orílẹ̀ èdè Nàíjíríà, Muhammadu Buhari ti bá àwọn ọmọ orílẹ̀ èdè Nàíjíríà yọ àyájọ́ ọdún tuntun 2020;
- English Sentence: President Muhammadu Buhari has felicitated with all Nigerians as they celebrate the beginning of another year.
